  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/01/P1330098.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(8 fotos) La Asociaci&oacute;n de Amas de Casa de Onda ha organizado un curso de cocina innovadora a cargo del chef del restaurante Gran Hotel Toledo, Javier Lozar Mu&ntilde;oz, en cuatro sesiones. La primera jornada se ha desarrollado la tarde del jueves en la sede de la asociaci&oacute;n. Las tres pr&oacute;ximas ser&aacute;n los tres jueves siguientes en la cocina del Centro de D&iacute;a municipal.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330094.jpg\" alt=\"p1330094\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330096.jpg\" alt=\"p1330096\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330098.jpg\" alt=\"p1330098\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330099.jpg\" alt=\"p1330099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330101.jpg\" alt=\"p1330101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330103.jpg\" alt=\"p1330103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330104.jpg\" alt=\"p1330104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/curscuinamestressescasajavierlozar/p1330105.jpg\" alt=\"p1330105\" style=\"max-width:1